  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian support for the children of Haiti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF estimates 4 million children are in need of urgent support in Haiti, as they face the compounding crises of gang violence and civil unrest, internal displacement, malnutrition and food insecurity, and the resurgence of cholera. UNICEF and partners will work to ensure access to basic goods and continuity of services including essential vaccinations, screening and treatment for malnutrition, protection from violence, continued learning opportunities and access to safe water and hygiene.</narrative>
  </description>
